(patient.age / 100 * 30) + (patient.get_total_conditions() * 5 * 25/100) + (patient.get_average_severity() * 10 * 25/100) + (20 if recent records have abnormal vitals else 0). The function uses Hospital.get_patient(patient_id) and Hospital.get_recent_records(patient_id, 90). Returns a float between 0.0 and 100.0.

Parameters:  
- hospital: Hospital object from dataset.patient_risk_analyzer.hospital  
- patient_id: string (patient identifier)

