- Uses:  
  - hospital.get_patient(patient_id)  
  - hospital.get_recent_records(patient_id, 90)  
  - Patient.get_total_conditions()  
  - Patient.get_average_severity()  
  - MedicalRecord.has_abnormal_vitals()  

Returns:  
- float (risk score between 0.0 and 100.0)
